@startuml
' Factory Method Pattern adapted to HealthTech.
' Suggested LaTeX placement: normal page.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

class SeparationService <<Client>> {
  +runSeparation(audioId)
}

class SeparationAlgorithmFactory <<Creator>> {
  +create(activeModel) : SeparationAlgorithm
}

interface SeparationAlgorithm <<Product>> {
  +separate(inputPath, modelConfig)
}

class NeoSSNetStrategy <<ConcreteProduct>> {
  +separate(inputPath, modelConfig)
}

class ONNXNeoSSNetStrategy <<Future ConcreteProduct>> {
  +separate(inputPath, modelConfig)
}

class ModelRepository {
  +findActiveModel()
}

class ModelRecord {
  +model_id : int
  +model_name : str
  +version : str
  +architecture : str
  +framework : str
  +checkpoint_path : str
  +config_path : str
  +is_active : bool
}

SeparationService --> ModelRepository : requests active model
SeparationService --> SeparationAlgorithmFactory : create(activeModel)
SeparationAlgorithmFactory ..> SeparationAlgorithm : returns product
SeparationAlgorithmFactory --> ModelRecord : reads architecture/framework
ModelRepository --> ModelRecord : returns
NeoSSNetStrategy ..|> SeparationAlgorithm
ONNXNeoSSNetStrategy ..|> SeparationAlgorithm
SeparationAlgorithmFactory ..> NeoSSNetStrategy : creates when active model is PyTorch NeoSSNet
SeparationAlgorithmFactory ..> ONNXNeoSSNetStrategy : creates in future if model is ONNX

note bottom
  Mapping:
  Creator = SeparationAlgorithmFactory
  Product = SeparationAlgorithm
  ConcreteProduct = NeoSSNetStrategy
  Client = SeparationService
end note

@enduml
